data: {"id":"gen-1794255515-5IvGKdrF0tOlA9ESHN6W","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1794255515,"model":"google/gemini-2.5-flash","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","reasoning":"**Assessing Root Cause Failures**\n\nI'm now digging into the root causes of all the failures. The first `AttributeError` indicates a simple misuse of the `webdriver.Chrome` constructor by passing a path as a string instead of using `ChromeOptions`. The subsequent `SessionNotCreatedException` for both Chrome and Firefox points to deeper environment issues, likely missing browser installations, dependencies, or configuration problems. Finally, `requests` and `BeautifulSoup` succeeded, confirming a problem *specific* to WebDriver setups.\n\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"**Assessing Root Cause Failures**\n\nI'm now digging into the root causes of all the failures. The first `AttributeError` indicates a simple misuse of the `webdriver.Chrome` constructor by passing a path as a string instead of using `ChromeOptions`. The subsequent `SessionNotCreatedException` for both Chrome and Firefox points to deeper environment issues, likely missing browser installations, dependencies, or configuration problems. Finally, `requests` and `BeautifulSoup` succeeded, confirming a problem *specific* to WebDriver setups.\n\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

